      "text": "How AI Inference works",
      "fontSize": 129.7399122931608,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How AI Inference works",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g5XBWTAIijFRWPPR-p6wS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145.97673960276916,
      "y": -2481.7534370489484,
      "width": 743.2599110125598,
      "height": 137.29507195031704,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 760129278,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 701621927,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "RmuLotmncs_6WHE_Dbbgy",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User (prompt)",
      "fontSize": 109.83605756025362,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User (prompt)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P8F-2x-Wc1PdVlSip3UEf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.3572261945847,
      "y": -2231.938765449414,
      "width": 750.1593017578125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 697880674,
      "version": 533,
      "versionNonce": 27425609,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "EL80uJy5rqSH2KVo11LX8",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tokenization steps\n1. Splitting: \"inference engine\" → [\"inference\", \"engine\"] or subword tokens\n2. Vocabulary lookup: Each token maps to unique ID (vocab size ~50k–150k)\n3. Post-Processing: add special tokens, truncate to the context window\n4. Special tokens: Add <BOS>, <EOS>, and chat turn markers\n5. Batching: modern engines (vLLM) use ragged / continuous batching with\n    NO padding to a fixed length. Fixed-length padding is a training-era idea.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tokenization steps\n1. Splitting: \"inference engine\" → [\"inference\", \"engine\"] or subword tokens\n2. Vocabulary lookup: Each token maps to unique ID (vocab size ~50k–150k)\n3. Post-Processing: add special tokens, truncate to the context window\n4. Special tokens: Add <BOS>, <EOS>, and chat turn markers\n5. Batching: modern engines (vLLM) use ragged / continuous batching with\n    NO padding to a fixed length. Fixed-length padding is a training-era idea.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lONhs896vmnllF-4tVVYz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.3572261945847,
      "y": -1636.735721533152,
      "width": 549.6795043945312,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1574295422,
      "version": 678,
      "versionNonce": 1011644871,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "cF9k6KqMC3wASJJ_sJJQB",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "High-performance systems check an in-memory cache (like\na Hash Map) for frequently used words to bypass the\nalgorithmic splitting rules.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "High-performance systems check an in-memory cache (like\na Hash Map) for frequently used words to bypass the\nalgorithmic splitting rules.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "z8mkzJZEyx1bvwm_hQCYi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.3572261945847,
      "y": -1296.7570520098784,
      "width": 486.95947265625,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 314129022,
      "version": 672,
      "versionNonce": 1478896169,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "fbp91Ie1oM-Jb-sM9EIyk",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The subword fragments are matched against a\nstatic, pre-trained dictionary (the vocab.json file)\nto find their unique numerical IDs.\n\nExample: you type the fictional word \"Zorblax\".\n\nBPE works BOTTOM-UP, not top-down. It does\nNOT look up the\nwhole word and then split it on failure.\nIt starts from raw bytes/characters and\nMERGES upward using\na ranked merge table (merges.txt):\n  Z,o,r,b,l,a,x  ->  Zor,bl,ax  ->  Zorb,lax\nAt each pass it applies the highest-priority merge\nrule still\navailable, stopping when none match.\n\n(Top-down greedy longest-match splitting is\nWordPiece/BERT,\na different algorithm.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The subword fragments are matched against a static, pre-trained dictionary (the vocab.json file) to find their unique numerical IDs.\n\nExample: you type the fictional word \"Zorblax\".\n\nBPE works BOTTOM-UP, not top-down. It does NOT look up the\nwhole word and then split it on failure.\nIt starts from raw bytes/characters and MERGES upward using\na ranked merge table (merges.txt):\n  Z,o,r,b,l,a,x  ->  Zor,bl,ax  ->  Zorb,lax\nAt each pass it applies the highest-priority merge rule still\navailable, stopping when none match.\n\n(Top-down greedy longest-match splitting is WordPiece/BERT,\na different algorithm.)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aftmdgP4wzkLakdar8zuw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.3572261945847,
      "y": -1470.6506869407885,
      "width": 279.0881643721057,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1037864482,
      "version": 937,
      "versionNonce": 1145546983,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Y9twgH5BJ74pYDJFdwMmn",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Token String     Token ID\nToken                1432\nization               481\nthe                   1\napple                 8542",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Token String     Token ID\nToken                1432\nization               481\nthe                   1\napple                 8542",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ogAg3MtzayWhQBMFfhqV-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.3572261945847,
      "y": -732.7870291116749,
      "width": 756,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1295637438,
      "version": 516,
      "versionNonce": 1141964041,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "YVrQnv6cmQ9Jx7nBrLxUZ",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1786029363639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What if you type a character that isn't even in the alphabet\nof the vocabulary?\n\nFor byte-level BPE (GPT-2/3/4, tiktoken) this NEVER happens.\nThe 256 raw byte values ARE the base of the vocabulary, so\nevery possible input is representable by construction.\nThere is no <UNK> token at all, ever.\n\n\"Byte fallback\" as a distinct named feature belongs to\nSentencePiece / Llama-style tokenizers, which start from\ncharacters and drop to raw bytes only for unseen ones.\n\n* Either way the unknown character becomes a sequence of\nbase byte tokens, and the vocab reserves 256 slots (0x00-0xFF).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What if you type a character that isn't even in the alphabet\nof the vocabulary?\n\nFor byte-level BPE (GPT-2/3/4, tiktoken) this NEVER happens.\nThe 256 raw byte values ARE the base of the vocabulary, so\nevery possible input is representable by construction.\nThere is no <UNK> token at all, ever.\n\n\"Byte fallback\" as a distinct named feature belongs to\nSentencePiece / Llama-style tokenizers, which start from\ncharacters and drop to raw bytes only for unseen ones.\n\n* Either way the unknown character becomes a sequence of\nbase byte tokens, and the vocab reserves 256 slots (0x00-0xFF).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
