    {
      "id": "NYy_Jv39BJaUTWHoZlWnL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6378.144450361682,
      "y": 8635.120774169483,
      "width": 475,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2410c",
      "text": "STEP 2: SCALED SCORES (Keeps Softmax Out of Saturation)\nFormula: Scaled = Scores / √d_k  (d_k = HEAD dim = 4 here, √4 = 2)\nReal Llama 3: d_k = 128 (4096 hidden / 32 heads) -> divide by √128\nResult Matrix (Divide each element by 2):\n[ -0.4880,  0.7494,  0.3925 ]\n[  0.1921,  0.9851,  0.6826 ]\n[ -0.1852,  0.5910,  0.2642 ]",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "version": 1587,
      "versionNonce": 313000327,
      "index": "b3z",
      "isDeleted": true,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "seed": 1029478351,
